ed:35551457, PubMed:37684232). Binds the lipid portion of GPI-anchor (PubMed:37684232). May act as an organizer in the transmembrane layer to recruit other subunits, and thus is essential for assembly of the complex (PubMed:35165458, PubMed:35551457)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}